{"title": "Glyph of Warding", "pageid": 2770, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Abjuration spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Dexterity saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Acid damage", "Sources of Lightning damage", "Sources of Cold damage", "Sources of Fire damage", "Sources of Thunder damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Glyph_of_Warding.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Glyph_of_Warding.webp/300px-Glyph_of_Warding.webp, /w/images/9/9b/Glyph_of_Warding.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Glyph_of_Warding.webp/300px-Glyph_of_Warding.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Glyph_of_Warding.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Glyph of Warding </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 abjuration spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to inscribe a ward that can trigger various magical effects when stepped on by an enemy.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Inscribe a circle of arcane glyphs on the ground. When stepped on by an enemy the selected magical effect will trigger.\n</p><p>The glyph will last until triggered, or until a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Only one glyph can be active at a time.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 4 m (13 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 4 m (13 ft) Radius</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>See each individual variant's page.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_GlyphOfWarding</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_GlyphOfWarding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_GlyphOfWarding\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Acid\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp/60px-Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp/80px-Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glyph of Warding: Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Glyph_of_Warding_Acid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Acid\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Acid\">Glyph of Warding: Acid</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Cold\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp/60px-Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp/80px-Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glyph of Warding: Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Glyph_of_Warding_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Cold\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Cold\">Glyph of Warding: Cold</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Detonation\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Detonation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp/60px-Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp/80px-Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glyph of Warding: Detonation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Glyph_of_Warding_Detonation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Detonation\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Detonation\">Glyph of Warding: Detonation</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Fire\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp/60px-Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp/80px-Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glyph of Warding: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Glyph_of_Warding_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Fire\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Fire\">Glyph of Warding: Fire</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Lightning\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp/60px-Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp/80px-Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glyph of Warding: Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Glyph_of_Warding_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Lightning\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Lightning\">Glyph of Warding: Lightning</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Sleep\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Sleep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp/60px-Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp/80px-Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glyph of Warding: Sleep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Glyph_of_Warding_Sleep_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Sleep\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Sleep\">Glyph of Warding: Sleep</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Thunder\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp/60px-Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp/80px-Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glyph of Warding: Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp/40px-Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Glyph_of_Warding_Thunder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding:_Thunder\" title=\"Glyph of Warding: Thunder\">Glyph of Warding: Thunder</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 5: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding\" title=\"Scroll of Glyph of Warding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Glyph_of_Warding\" title=\"Scroll of Glyph of Warding\">Scroll of Glyph of Warding</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When the glyph is triggered, each of those affected by it rolls a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. If a creature successfully saves, they only take half the damage for the elemental variants of this spell, and suffers no ill effect for the sleep and detonation variants.</li>\n<li>Only those considered an enemy can trigger the glyph. When the glyph is triggered everyone within the area is affected, regardless of allegiance.\n<ul><li>Enemies are indicated via a red circle beneath the creature, red outlines when highlighted, and denoted by a red dot in the minimap. Neutral, friendly, and allied creatures (highlighted yellow, green, or blue respectively) can safely traverse the glyph.</li>\n<li>If the glyph is cast in an area where hostile creatures are already present, it triggers immediately.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Only one glyph per caster can be active at a time. If a creature with an active glyph casts the spell again, the previous one vanishes with no effect.\n<ul><li>Active glyphs also vanish harmlessly if the caster is dismissed from the party.</li></ul></li>\n<li>When the spellcaster is surrounded by enemies, it is sometimes worth throwing the glyph down right at their feet. This is true for most AOE spells, but especially so for the sleep variant of Glyph of Warding:\n<ul><li>The shared Initiative system means an ally can immediately shove/help the spellcaster awake should they fall asleep due to their own glyph.</li>\n<li>Magical Sleep Immunity is fairly common, either from an <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Peerless_Focus\" title=\"Elixir of Peerless Focus\">Elixir of Peerless Focus</a> or from <a href=\"/wiki/Fey_Ancestry\" title=\"Fey Ancestry\">Fey Ancestry</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>, being a <a href=\"/wiki/Half-Elf\" title=\"Half-Elf\">Half-Elf</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a>, can naturally utilize this tactic starting from level 5.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>The incantation for Glyph of Warding is <b>Ira Et Dolor</b>, Latin for <i>\"Anger and pain\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/f/f0/Glyph_of_Warding_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Glyph_of_Warding_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Glyph_of_Warding_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Glyph_of_warding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt